Setup and create
1. Run terraform/backend/setup-backend.sh
2. Run terraform/infrastructure terraform apply
3. Run tasks/create-auth-token-param.sh (interactive - prompts for token, or set AUTH_TOKEN env var)
4. Run CI workflow (builds images)
5. Run CD workflow (deploys services)

Quick setup:
  task setup

Cleanup
1. Run tasks/cleanup-storage.sh (empties ECR and S3)
2. Run terraform/service2 terraform destroy
3. Run terraform/service1 terraform destroy
4. Run terraform/infrastructure terraform destroy
5. Run terraform/backend/delete-backend.sh

Quick cleanup:
  task destroy

Utilities
- task test:all - Run all unit tests
- task test:flow - Test E2E flow
- task info - Show endpoints
- task status - Show service status
- task logs:service1 - Tail service1 logs
- task logs:service2 - Tail service2 logs

